orand?dataType=dailyRevenue","volume_source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/overview/dexs/Algorand?dataType=dailyVolume","stablecoin_source_url":"https://stablecoins.llama.fi/stablecoinchains","methodology_note":"Fees are intentionally low, so fee revenue cannot be compared with high-fee chains without considering usage and subsidy economics."},"team":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","founders":[{"name":"Silvio Micali","role":"founder and protocol designer","source_url":"https://dev.algorand.co/getting-started/why-algorand/"}],"entity":"Algorand Foundation stewards ecosystem and governance; Algorand Technologies develops core protocol software.","key_events":[{"date":"2019-06-19","type":"foundation_launch","description":"The Foundation launched mainnet.","source_url":"https://dev.algorand.co/getting-started/why-algorand/"},{"date":"2025-07","type":"governance_transition","description":"The xGov platform began a new phase for community funding decisions.","source_url":"https://governance.algorand.foundation/"}],"regulatory_status":null},"narrative":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","purpose":"Provide fast-finality, low-cost, permissionless infrastructure for payments, tokenized assets, and applications.","positioning":"A Pure Proof-of-Stake L1 using VRF-selected committees, instant finality, native asset primitives, and low hardware requirements.","competitors":[{"name":"Stellar","relationship":"payments and asset-tokenization competitor"},{"name":"Solana","relationship":"fast low-fee L1 competitor"},{"name":"Hedera","relationship":"enterprise adoption competitor"}],"narrative_arc":"Algorand''s cryptographic design and reliable finality earned institutional interest, but ecosystem capital and ALGO price contracted as EVM and Solana ecosystems captured more developers and liquidity.","media_sentiment":"negative"},"risk":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","exploits":[],"sanctions":{"flagged":false,"detail":"No chain-level designation is asserted; archived exact-name SDN review remains open."},"extraction_flag