ove ecosystem funding gradually toward xGov."],"unknowns":["Current online-stake, relay, proposer, Foundation-wallet, and governance concentration.","Long-run proposer economics after bonus rewards decay.","Application and stablecoin concentration within remaining liquidity.","How much non-DeFi payment and tokenization activity translates into recurring demand."],"lessons_learned":["Excellent consensus properties do not substitute for application distribution.","Low fees help adoption while weakening fee-based value capture.","Progressive governance decentralization requires transparent treasury and stake data."],"could_differ":"EVM compatibility could broaden tooling access, but would compromise Algorand''s native VM and protocol-specific execution advantages.","outlook":{"bull":"Payments and tokenization grow while staking rewards deepen participation.","base":"Algorand remains technically resilient with modest activity.","bear":"Weak fees and developer liquidity keep the chain dependent on Foundation subsidies.","most_likely":"base"},"cause_tags":["pure_proof_of_stake","vrf_committees","low_fees","foundation_dependency","ecosystem_contraction"],"confidence":"high"}},"meta":{"dimension_completeness_pct":100,"data_completeness_pct":84,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["capital.total_raised_usd","capital.treasury_usd","team.regulatory_status","risk.audit_status","risk.archived_sanctions_check","risk.current_stake_and_relay_concentration","onchain.active_addresses_daily","onchain.dev_activity_monthly","onchain.tvl_concentration","synthesis.non_defi_usage_value"],"last_reviewed":"2026-07-29"}},{"chain":"ICP","source_catalog":{"coverage":{"title":"Chaindump top-50 chain coverage snapshot","url":"https://chaindump.xyz/api/chains"},"whitepaper":{"title":"Internet Computer technical overview","url":"https://internetcomputer.org/whitepaper.pdf"},"governance":{"title":"ICP NNS and SNS governance","url":"https://docs.internetcomputer.org/concepts/governance/"},"economi